            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for a foothill, then the Marathi for a mountain range."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ओढा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ओढा — oḍhā — \"a stream; a brook\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गावाबाहेरून एक लहान ओढा वाहतो. gāvābāherūn ek lahān oḍhā vāhto. A small stream flows past the village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Plural: ओढे, oḍhe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Smaller than a नदी; in the dry season many ओढे dry up."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ओढा (oḍhā) is a Marathi word for a small stream; its origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
